WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.420 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 4]

01:51.200 --> 01:51.930
It's you?

01:52.710 --> 01:53.410
You are here.

01:57.120 --> 01:57.930
Who brought you inside?

01:58.430 --> 01:59.380
You handpicked everyone

01:59.400 --> 02:00.690
in the Spider Shadow Sect.

02:01.640 --> 02:02.410
Don't you trust them?

02:03.920 --> 02:05.050
I believe in the results more.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.620
All of them have been loyal to you.

02:08.120 --> 02:09.220
You shouldn't suspect them.

02:10.000 --> 02:10.570
However,

02:11.560 --> 02:12.690
you made a mistake.

02:13.400 --> 02:13.850
What?

02:14.400 --> 02:15.410
They are loyal to you

02:15.630 --> 02:17.100
but it doesn't mean they are loyal to the Patriarch.

02:17.520 --> 02:18.100
If they think

02:18.120 --> 02:19.260
you made the wrong choice,

02:20.080 --> 02:21.340
they will also think of a way

02:21.800 --> 02:23.100
to guide you on the right path.

02:24.120 --> 02:24.820
Let's leave it here for today,

02:24.840 --> 02:25.290
Su Muyu.

02:25.750 --> 02:27.170
You have many surprises around you.

02:27.710 --> 02:29.010
More than I can imagine.

02:33.910 --> 02:34.450
Miracle physician,

02:37.360 --> 02:38.010
I beg you.

02:39.240 --> 02:39.660
Don't pull it.

02:40.310 --> 02:41.290
I almost forgot

02:41.520 --> 02:42.450
that both of you were close friends.

02:43.280 --> 02:43.890
However,

02:44.030 --> 02:45.010
I was almost killed by him just now.

02:45.750 --> 02:46.170
Sorry.

02:47.400 --> 02:48.410
Didn't you say the Spider's Nest

02:48.470 --> 02:49.410
was impenetrable?

02:49.840 --> 02:50.450
How did he

02:50.470 --> 02:51.610
sneak in so easily?

02:52.680 --> 02:53.500
There must be a spy.

02:54.150 --> 02:54.890
Don't worry, miracle physician.

02:55.710 --> 02:56.290
I will deal with it.

02:57.910 --> 02:59.010
You saw it just now.

02:59.870 --> 03:00.780
Phantom Step

03:01.000 --> 03:01.940
and Three-Needle Thread.

03:03.910 --> 03:05.260
I only saw Three-Needle Thread.

03:06.560 --> 03:08.340
I didn't expect you to know the move, Phantom Step.

03:08.960 --> 03:09.820
That move...

03:10.080 --> 03:10.570
What about it?

03:11.120 --> 03:11.940
It's quite hard to master.

03:13.310 --> 03:14.290
Do you

03:15.150 --> 03:16.690
not have any questions for me?

03:17.590 --> 03:19.130
Miracle physician, you know more

03:19.800 --> 03:21.380
about Blood River than ordinary people.

03:22.680 --> 03:23.850
I think

03:24.630 --> 03:26.940
there must be something else apart from the grudge between the Patriarch

03:28.000 --> 03:29.380
and the former Medicine King.

03:30.680 --> 03:32.170
However, they are not related to today's matter.

03:33.910 --> 03:35.380
I only want to confirm one thing.

03:35.910 --> 03:36.450
What is it?

03:37.310 --> 03:38.820
You are indeed doing your utmost to find a way

03:38.910 --> 03:40.130
to treat the Patriarch,

03:40.520 --> 03:41.060
right?

03:41.630 --> 03:42.170
Yes.

03:43.280 --> 03:44.500
I will do all I can

03:44.560 --> 03:45.500
to treat the Patriarch.

03:46.840 --> 03:48.290
I'll also make you a promise then.

03:49.360 --> 03:50.290
From today onward,

03:50.630 --> 03:51.780
until the Patriarch is treated,

03:52.310 --> 03:53.660
I, Su Muyu, will not let anyone hurt you

03:54.280 --> 03:55.940
as long as I'm alive.

03:59.520 --> 04:00.540
Unless I die before you.

04:01.310 --> 04:02.980
Can I trust the words of someone from Blood River?

04:05.520 --> 04:06.940
I heard you were a nameless person.

04:07.520 --> 04:08.940
Before you joined Blood River,

04:09.680 --> 04:10.340
where were you?

04:11.240 --> 04:11.730
No-sword City.

04:12.310 --> 04:12.850
No-sword City?

04:13.710 --> 04:15.220
The city of swords that was unmatched in swordsmanship

04:15.520 --> 04:16.930
yet got wiped out in one night?

04:17.310 --> 04:17.930
Didn't they say

04:18.160 --> 04:20.340
no one from the city survived?

04:21.270 --> 04:22.460
I heard you loved listening to stories.

04:23.750 --> 04:25.170
If we are lucky enough to overcome this hurdle this time,

04:26.160 --> 04:26.730
I'll tell you

04:26.750 --> 04:27.850
my story.

04:31.500 --> 04:33.540
[Shuying Villa]

04:37.680 --> 04:38.100
Boss,

04:38.920 --> 04:39.810
when did you come inside?

04:40.430 --> 04:41.340
I didn't even realize.

04:42.750 --> 04:44.140
I've been to the Spider's Nest a few times.

04:45.390 --> 04:46.460
Of course, I know

04:47.870 --> 04:48.930
how to sneak inside.

04:50.070 --> 04:50.780
I forgot about it.

04:51.830 --> 04:53.370
There are 36 traps here.

04:54.390 --> 04:56.100
It'll be difficult even for a formidable martial artist

04:56.870 --> 04:57.900
to leave here alive.

04:59.000 --> 04:59.540
Unless

05:00.480 --> 05:01.700
the infiltrator knows this place's structure

05:01.750 --> 05:02.490
very well.

05:04.040 --> 05:04.610
For example, me.

05:05.800 --> 05:06.730
However, even someone like me

05:08.920 --> 05:09.780
has no choice

05:12.190 --> 05:13.490
but to go through one place.

05:14.750 --> 05:15.250
Where is it?

05:18.600 --> 05:19.050
Here.

05:19.950 --> 05:21.540
This is the core of the Spider's Nest.

05:22.390 --> 05:22.850
There are

05:22.870 --> 05:24.250
a total of four ways

05:24.390 --> 05:25.370
to avoid the 36 traps,

05:26.600 --> 05:27.460
but every way

05:32.560 --> 05:33.900
passes through this place.

05:40.390 --> 05:42.020
When I came here last night,

05:42.830 --> 05:43.540
there was no one here

05:44.600 --> 05:45.170
and you

05:47.750 --> 05:49.340
were the one in charge of guarding this place.

05:58.720 --> 05:59.610
You should die.

06:08.160 --> 06:09.410
Tell me why you betray me.

06:11.800 --> 06:12.170
Boss,

06:13.480 --> 06:14.250
you know more than anyone

06:15.480 --> 06:16.540
that the Patriarch's poison

06:16.630 --> 06:17.370
cannot be cured.

06:17.920 --> 06:18.540
Even if it can be cured,

06:18.560 --> 06:19.730
he'll only live for a few more years.

06:20.240 --> 06:21.050
He should abdicate his position.

06:27.600 --> 06:28.140
You may leave.

06:30.720 --> 06:31.930
Don't appear here anymore.

06:33.390 --> 06:33.900
Boss!

06:34.480 --> 06:35.340
Just kill the Patriarch

06:35.480 --> 06:36.250
and take the Dormant Dragon Sword.

06:36.390 --> 06:37.810
Then, everything will be over!

06:42.270 --> 06:44.020
I will kill you if I must.

06:59.920 --> 07:01.050
You will never protect everyone.

07:28.160 --> 07:28.730
You

07:29.270 --> 07:30.900
shouldn't have spared him.

07:37.600 --> 07:39.050
You are the Kui of Blood River.

07:40.040 --> 07:41.700
In terms of our rank in Blood River,

07:42.310 --> 07:44.140
you are many ranks higher than I am.

07:45.070 --> 07:46.490
There's no need to show me respect.

07:49.800 --> 07:50.900
Betraying the Spider Shadow Sect

07:52.270 --> 07:54.410
is the greatest crime in Blood River.

07:55.680 --> 07:56.540
But we can

07:58.630 --> 08:00.340
only punish someone when they are alive, right?

08:02.920 --> 08:03.980
In the current situation,

08:05.680 --> 08:06.700
the Patriarch of Blood River

08:06.830 --> 08:08.460
can even be pursued by the Three Families.

08:10.600 --> 08:11.340
Do the rules

08:12.800 --> 08:14.020
still mean anything?

08:15.830 --> 08:17.850
I met you a few times

08:19.000 --> 08:21.020
and heard some of your rumors.

08:25.190 --> 08:27.220
Apparently, you have a title

08:27.870 --> 08:29.050
in Soul Reapers' Hall

08:29.630 --> 08:31.290
called Three Refusals.

08:32.840 --> 08:34.770
You don't annihilate families.

08:35.630 --> 08:37.220
You don't accept jobs without knowing the reason.

08:38.030 --> 08:39.730
You don't accept jobs you don't want to.

08:43.600 --> 08:45.650
I've been a part of Blood River my whole life

08:46.360 --> 08:48.420
and you are the only one

08:49.200 --> 08:52.130
who can negotiate with Soul Reapers' Hall.

08:53.270 --> 08:54.460
Because I have a friend

08:56.150 --> 08:57.100
who also had a similar story.

08:58.360 --> 09:00.220
For the missions that Su Muyu wouldn't accept,

09:01.080 --> 09:02.010
I'll accept them all.

09:03.030 --> 09:04.370
He hid this from me for many years.

09:04.870 --> 09:06.940
He must be Su Changhe.

09:08.440 --> 09:10.250
The Undertaker, Su Changhe.

09:11.200 --> 09:11.770
Apparently,

09:12.720 --> 09:14.130
his swordsmanship isn't as good as yours

09:14.720 --> 09:16.530
but his title of the Undertaker

09:16.870 --> 09:18.250
terrorizes people

09:18.630 --> 09:21.100
more than your title of Umbrella Ghost.

09:23.200 --> 09:24.700
It's good of you

09:25.510 --> 09:26.850
to have a friend like him.

09:29.600 --> 09:30.180
I know.

09:31.270 --> 09:33.300
However, members of Blood River

09:34.320 --> 09:35.850
need no friends.

09:36.910 --> 09:37.530
Friends

09:38.270 --> 09:40.530
will only make you hesitate while wielding your sword.

09:43.000 --> 09:43.730
Su Muyu,

09:45.270 --> 09:47.180
you are a genius

09:47.790 --> 09:48.770
who used an incomplete manual

09:48.960 --> 09:50.700
to restore the Eighteen-Sword Array.

09:51.550 --> 09:52.300
I didn't expect you

09:53.000 --> 09:53.820
to be

09:54.000 --> 09:55.530
an extremely foolish person.

09:56.440 --> 09:57.250
What do you mean, Elder?

09:58.750 --> 10:00.530
You want to be a good person.

10:01.120 --> 10:02.220
However, you want to do that

10:02.360 --> 10:04.220
as an assassin.

10:04.790 --> 10:06.980
Isn't that the funniest

10:08.120 --> 10:09.730
and most foolish thing in the world?

10:17.910 --> 10:19.540
[Seven Years Ago]
Do you know?

10:19.550 --> 10:21.420
[Wailing Abyss]
No matter who comes out alive,

10:21.440 --> 10:22.700
[Seven Years Ago, Wailing Abyss]
one of you will join the Su family.

10:22.840 --> 10:23.340
However,

10:23.390 --> 10:24.700
if both of you come out alive,

10:25.000 --> 10:25.580
you'll break

10:25.600 --> 10:26.490
the rules of Blood River

10:26.670 --> 10:27.650
and must die.

10:28.910 --> 10:29.530
I know.

10:30.670 --> 10:31.220
No. 17,

10:32.360 --> 10:33.700
kill the person beside you.

10:42.030 --> 10:43.130
I won't kill him.

10:45.030 --> 10:46.060
Both of us

10:47.390 --> 10:48.650
must survive.

10:51.510 --> 10:52.100
Sure.

10:53.720 --> 10:54.300
Wonderful.

10:55.240 --> 10:56.300
In a dire situation,

10:57.000 --> 10:58.730
you still care about the person beside you.

10:59.480 --> 11:00.250
Both of you

11:00.320 --> 11:01.300
are such close friends.

11:01.550 --> 11:02.490
We are not friends.

11:03.360 --> 11:04.940
Assassins shouldn't have friends.

11:06.550 --> 11:08.010
But if we both join Blood River,

11:09.080 --> 11:10.370
we will be family.

11:12.150 --> 11:13.060
If we are family,

11:13.840 --> 11:15.130
how can I abandon him?

11:15.360 --> 11:17.420
Do you know what you are saying?

11:23.720 --> 11:24.730
Just kill me, quick.

11:26.790 --> 11:27.700
Don't be foolish.

11:30.630 --> 11:31.700
You are no match for him.

12:04.870 --> 12:05.940
If you are going to kill him,

12:08.120 --> 12:09.490
I will kill you.

12:11.360 --> 12:12.130
Stop.

12:20.720 --> 12:21.610
Sir.

12:21.720 --> 12:22.460
Sir.

12:24.440 --> 12:25.010
Kid,

12:26.360 --> 12:28.100
your actions today

12:28.550 --> 12:31.250
are a challenge to Blood River's authority.

12:32.320 --> 12:34.340
You are also challenging my authority.

12:35.840 --> 12:36.980
Do you think

12:37.360 --> 12:38.580
it is worth it for Blood River

12:39.790 --> 12:40.940
to break its rules once

12:41.870 --> 12:43.220
for both of you?

12:43.720 --> 12:44.530
Yes.

12:48.550 --> 12:49.460
Both of us

12:49.910 --> 12:50.980
will surely become

12:51.390 --> 12:53.060
the best assassins of Blood River in this century

12:53.080 --> 12:54.370
within three years.

12:55.120 --> 12:58.460
Blood River will transform because of us.

12:58.910 --> 12:59.820
Kid,

13:01.750 --> 13:02.530
I'll remember

13:03.120 --> 13:04.060
what you said.

13:04.600 --> 13:05.370
Fool.

13:06.080 --> 13:06.850
We will

13:07.600 --> 13:08.650
die together now.

13:09.910 --> 13:11.060
The rules exist

13:11.360 --> 13:12.980
to be broken.

13:13.840 --> 13:15.730
Blood River has broken many rules

13:16.630 --> 13:18.130
in the last century

13:19.000 --> 13:19.460
but the rules

13:19.960 --> 13:21.060
were only broken

13:21.390 --> 13:22.700
when the offenders

13:23.150 --> 13:25.130
were powerful enough.

13:26.080 --> 13:26.580
Today,

13:27.200 --> 13:27.770
I will

13:28.910 --> 13:30.580
break the rules once for you.

13:36.670 --> 13:38.980
I will also give you a name.

13:39.670 --> 13:40.340
However,

13:40.720 --> 13:42.180
you need to prove your ability

13:42.510 --> 13:43.340
to me.

13:44.030 --> 13:45.650
I'm willing to take a sword strike from you, Sir.

13:47.270 --> 13:47.890
If I die,

13:49.910 --> 13:50.890
he will be the only one

13:51.000 --> 13:52.060
leaving the Wailing Abyss.

13:53.440 --> 13:54.940
Please spare his life.

13:57.390 --> 13:58.820
If I'm still alive,

14:01.600 --> 14:02.700
I hope

14:02.870 --> 14:04.220
you give us a chance.

14:05.550 --> 14:06.980
You are loyal.

14:08.000 --> 14:08.980
Sir, please

14:10.200 --> 14:10.940
attack me.

14:15.270 --> 14:15.820
All right.

14:31.910 --> 14:32.890
Remember.

14:34.550 --> 14:35.460
What I'm granting you

14:36.200 --> 14:37.700
isn't the strike

14:38.630 --> 14:40.180
but also the fate of your future.

14:40.790 --> 14:41.340
Are you

14:42.510 --> 14:44.580
going to accept my grace?

14:46.030 --> 14:47.180
Thank you, Sir.

14:50.790 --> 14:51.730
Among the three families,

14:52.630 --> 14:54.580
which family do you want to go to?

14:57.270 --> 14:57.940
He and I

15:02.000 --> 15:03.130
are going to the Su family.

15:07.670 --> 15:08.460
Great.

15:09.360 --> 15:10.490
From now on,

15:11.240 --> 15:14.610
both of you are family members of the Su family.

15:19.600 --> 15:21.300
A fool like you

15:24.030 --> 15:25.060
actually did it.

15:28.360 --> 15:29.370
I have to do my best

15:33.000 --> 15:33.850
for some things.

15:35.480 --> 15:37.850
[Luojiuxiao Inn]
Before you leave, I gave you the token

15:38.270 --> 15:39.130
to deploy

15:39.240 --> 15:41.180
all the elite members of the Su family.

15:42.270 --> 15:43.180
However,

15:43.790 --> 15:45.980
it seemed like you didn't cherish this power.

15:47.200 --> 15:48.420
Even Su Zhe

15:49.240 --> 15:51.420
was someone I helped you deploy.

15:54.790 --> 15:56.340
I don't want the Su family

15:56.480 --> 15:57.940
to confront Spider Shadow Sect head-on.

15:58.510 --> 15:59.180
Doing that

15:59.240 --> 16:00.180
will ruin your reputation

16:00.360 --> 16:01.180
and hurt the elite members

16:01.270 --> 16:02.130
of the Su family.

16:02.910 --> 16:03.580
However,

16:04.030 --> 16:05.460
I almost retrieved it just now

16:05.480 --> 16:06.370
without lifting a finger.

16:07.120 --> 16:07.890
So, Old Man,

16:08.360 --> 16:10.140
[Su Family's Head, Su Jinhui]
please believe in me.

16:10.150 --> 16:10.940
[Su Family's Head, Su Jinhui]
Within ten days,

16:11.320 --> 16:12.610
I'll help you retrieve the Dormant Dragon Sword.

16:13.360 --> 16:14.130
Nonsense!

16:22.600 --> 16:24.580
Old Man, let's talk this out.

16:27.030 --> 16:28.460
Why did you unsheathe your sword?

16:29.000 --> 16:30.820
Did I say I was going to kill him?

16:35.720 --> 16:37.130
You might not believe me

16:37.870 --> 16:38.650
but the sword

16:38.840 --> 16:40.420
actually came out on its own.

16:43.870 --> 16:44.370
Right?

16:46.240 --> 16:46.650
Yes.

16:51.910 --> 16:52.940
You have

16:53.320 --> 16:55.300
never disappointed me.

16:56.080 --> 16:57.490
I hope

16:57.510 --> 16:59.010
you don't disappoint me again this time.

16:59.840 --> 17:01.530
Where did you go last night?

17:02.030 --> 17:03.420
I asked Su Zhe.

17:03.790 --> 17:04.900
He said he fell asleep

17:05.240 --> 17:06.490
and knew nothing.

17:07.590 --> 17:09.620
I went to scout the Spider's Nest.

17:13.640 --> 17:14.810
Did you do that alone?

17:18.830 --> 17:20.180
Many elite members of the Su family

17:20.310 --> 17:22.140
were hiding in Jiuxiao City.

17:22.270 --> 17:23.220
Why didn't you use them?

17:24.480 --> 17:25.900
Did you not trust them

17:26.310 --> 17:27.050
or

17:27.720 --> 17:29.940
were you worried that they might expose you?

17:37.880 --> 17:39.530
What are you saying, Old Man?

17:40.270 --> 17:41.220
I went to scout the place

17:41.240 --> 17:42.380
and not to kill someone.

17:48.270 --> 17:50.730
Although you are just a nobody,

17:51.830 --> 17:53.490
the only person in the Su family

17:53.640 --> 17:56.700
who has the highest chance of succeeding this task

17:57.480 --> 17:58.380
is you.

18:02.160 --> 18:03.770
I will give you more time.

18:05.160 --> 18:06.420
Get the job done

18:07.400 --> 18:09.010
and do it nicely.

18:09.440 --> 18:11.700
Don't let me down.

18:13.350 --> 18:13.980
That's right.

18:15.550 --> 18:17.700
I peeled the apple for you.

18:18.240 --> 18:18.660
Eat.

18:27.070 --> 18:28.140
Farewell, Old Man.

18:56.480 --> 18:57.620
Isn't this Chou the Ox?

18:58.240 --> 19:00.420
One of the Twelve Zodiacs of Spider Shadow

19:01.070 --> 19:02.700
isn't protecting the Patriarch in the Spider's Nest

19:03.480 --> 19:05.050
but strolling around the city

19:05.070 --> 19:06.050
sneakily.

19:06.400 --> 19:08.770
Are you trying to escape?

19:09.590 --> 19:10.530
Are you two from the Xie family?

19:10.720 --> 19:11.250
Yes.

19:12.550 --> 19:13.810
You've never seen us before

19:14.240 --> 19:14.770
but

19:15.270 --> 19:16.140
I have.

19:16.480 --> 19:17.090
When you became

19:17.110 --> 19:18.730
the Twelve Zodiacs of Spider Shadow,

19:18.960 --> 19:19.620
I went to the ceremony.

19:19.880 --> 19:20.730
I remember

19:20.750 --> 19:22.050
you swore an oath on stage

19:22.240 --> 19:24.180
to stay loyal to the Patriarch for life.

19:24.640 --> 19:25.570
Your expression

19:26.110 --> 19:27.330
was firm and confident.

19:27.830 --> 19:29.250
I never expected you

19:30.000 --> 19:31.490
to escape the Spider's Nest now.

19:33.030 --> 19:33.770
So,

19:34.590 --> 19:35.980
have you betrayed the Patriarch?

19:36.440 --> 19:37.290
It has nothing to do with you.

19:37.640 --> 19:38.050
Don't move.

19:41.110 --> 19:41.980
He asked you not to move

19:42.270 --> 19:43.490
because it's a good advice.

19:45.790 --> 19:46.900
You should hand over

19:46.920 --> 19:47.940
the map of the traps inside Spider's Nest.

19:48.550 --> 19:49.290
Then, I'll spare you.

19:49.720 --> 19:50.660
Dream on.

20:01.920 --> 20:02.460
Who are you?

20:02.590 --> 20:03.490
I've never heard of

20:03.510 --> 20:03.980
such a good Dragonfang Saber

20:04.030 --> 20:04.940
in the Xie family.

20:05.240 --> 20:06.620
Of course, you've never heard about it.

20:06.960 --> 20:08.180
To defeat the Spider Shadow Sect,

20:08.480 --> 20:09.730
Every family has nurtured

20:09.750 --> 20:10.490
a group of experts.

20:10.880 --> 20:11.460
Every one of us

20:11.880 --> 20:13.700
is no worse than Su Muyu.

20:14.830 --> 20:15.620
How dare you

20:16.070 --> 20:17.460
compare yourself with the Boss?

20:18.310 --> 20:19.220
How do

20:19.830 --> 20:21.250
my saber techniques fare against

20:21.590 --> 20:22.140
his sword techniques?

20:25.270 --> 20:25.980
The Boss's sword techniques

20:26.440 --> 20:27.980
are so much stronger than yours.

20:28.240 --> 20:29.660
I hope you are not lying.

20:38.750 --> 20:39.940
Why did you kill him?

20:40.270 --> 20:41.090
He won't tell us.

20:42.200 --> 20:43.090
I could see it.

20:46.070 --> 20:46.730
Besides,

20:47.070 --> 20:48.490
the young master of the Mu family

20:48.640 --> 20:50.010
has already poisoned him with his Paper Butterflies.

20:50.880 --> 20:51.810
It's better

20:52.480 --> 20:53.570
to kill him immediately.

20:54.160 --> 20:57.940
What is your name?

20:59.750 --> 21:00.220
Buxie.

21:03.400 --> 21:05.060
[Xie Family, Xie Buxie]
I mean

21:05.070 --> 21:07.020
[Xie Family, Xie Buxie]
my name

21:07.030 --> 21:08.020
[Xie Family, Xie Buxie]
is Buxie.

21:13.550 --> 21:15.140
I'm unlucky to team up with you for a mission.

21:15.920 --> 21:16.330
Move.

21:25.640 --> 21:26.180
Let's go.

21:29.720 --> 21:30.290
Trying to leave?

21:31.070 --> 21:31.980
I finally found

21:32.030 --> 21:32.900
a spider who was left alone.

21:33.270 --> 21:34.180
If you hadn't killed him,

21:34.880 --> 21:36.140
I might be able

21:36.590 --> 21:38.330
to extract more information out of him with my poison.

21:38.790 --> 21:39.420
Who are you?

21:41.880 --> 21:43.290
She is Mu Xuewei from the Mu family.

21:43.640 --> 21:44.420
Her codename is Poisonous Blossom.

21:46.680 --> 21:47.180
Dodge it.

21:49.400 --> 21:50.420
Your saber techniques are not bad.

21:50.790 --> 21:51.700
[Mu Family, Mu Xuewei]
Unfortunately...

21:51.920 --> 21:52.700
What about it?

21:59.350 --> 22:00.980
He is Xie Qianji from the Xie family.

22:02.920 --> 22:04.250
Among the disciples of the Xie family,

22:04.830 --> 22:05.330
he is the best

22:05.920 --> 22:07.380
at setting up traps and arrays.

22:08.880 --> 22:09.490
We are all here

22:09.510 --> 22:10.660
for the same goal.

22:11.270 --> 22:12.620
There's no need to go against each other.

22:17.350 --> 22:18.940
If I remember correctly,

22:19.160 --> 22:19.900
you should be the one from the Mu family

22:19.920 --> 22:20.940
who knows fortune-telling,

22:21.200 --> 22:21.810
Mu Qingyang.

22:22.640 --> 22:23.180
That's right.

22:24.070 --> 22:24.490
Come.

22:24.920 --> 22:26.060
[Mu Family, Mu Qingyang]
Let me take a look at our fortune

22:26.070 --> 22:27.620
[Mu Family, Mu Qingyang]
and see if we are lucky.

22:30.200 --> 22:31.250
Peach blossom is a good omen.

22:31.590 --> 22:32.660
Mahogany sword is a bad omen.

22:33.160 --> 22:33.900
What do you think?

22:35.640 --> 22:37.660
Is that fortune-telling?

22:39.270 --> 22:40.730
The way is simple.

22:45.400 --> 22:46.010
There's someone else here!

22:50.550 --> 22:51.730
Acting mysterious.

22:56.510 --> 22:57.010
Stop.

22:57.350 --> 22:58.660
He is Mu Bai from the Mu family.

22:59.200 --> 22:59.860
Mu Bai?

23:05.640 --> 23:06.810
However, the Xie family

23:06.830 --> 23:07.730
lacks sincerity.

23:08.400 --> 23:09.380
They actually sent

23:09.510 --> 23:10.810
a dying person,

23:11.720 --> 23:13.010
Xie Fanhua.

23:15.920 --> 23:17.220
Since I'm dying,

23:18.200 --> 23:19.810
I'm no longer afraid of death.

23:20.880 --> 23:21.730
The six of us

23:22.510 --> 23:23.050
will be in charge

23:23.880 --> 23:26.490
of tearing down the webs that protect the Spider's Nest tomorrow.

23:48.400 --> 23:48.900
Miracle physician.

23:51.440 --> 23:52.180
Do you have something on your mind?

23:52.960 --> 23:54.900
Are you worried about Ms. Yumo?

23:56.030 --> 23:56.490
Yes.

23:57.510 --> 23:58.090
Do you

23:58.830 --> 23:59.490
like her?

24:02.310 --> 24:02.860
I do.

24:04.160 --> 24:04.940
But it's not the kind

24:05.030 --> 24:05.730
that you are thinking of.

24:06.960 --> 24:08.250
I like her as a family member.

24:16.030 --> 24:16.770
Muyu.

24:19.830 --> 24:20.380
Sir.

24:22.790 --> 24:25.090
Sir, you are finally awake.

24:26.750 --> 24:27.730
It seems like

24:28.310 --> 24:30.090
I've been sleeping for a long time.

24:32.720 --> 24:33.980
Since you are awake,

24:34.350 --> 24:34.860
I will

24:35.030 --> 24:36.570
use the Soul-Swap Technique on you

24:37.070 --> 24:37.770
to find a way

24:37.960 --> 24:39.460
of curing Snow Falls on a Plum Blossom

24:39.590 --> 24:40.090
for good.

24:40.830 --> 24:42.010
Thank you, miracle physician.

24:43.680 --> 24:44.730
Before that,

24:45.960 --> 24:47.810
I have something to say to Muyu.

24:48.200 --> 24:49.940
In that case, I'll leave you two alone.

25:02.240 --> 25:03.090
Muyu,

25:04.270 --> 25:05.250
you've worked hard

25:05.830 --> 25:06.490
up to this point.

25:07.200 --> 25:07.860
You must have

25:08.750 --> 25:09.380
met

25:09.400 --> 25:10.700
many troublesome opponents.

25:12.440 --> 25:13.290
I did meet

25:13.350 --> 25:14.090
some troublesome opponents.

25:14.880 --> 25:15.530
Thankfully,

25:15.640 --> 25:16.810
I made it to Jiuxiao City

25:17.550 --> 25:18.460
before you are cured of your poison, Sir.

25:25.110 --> 25:26.940
The Three Families will not stop attacking.

25:28.480 --> 25:29.250
Their next step

25:30.160 --> 25:31.730
will probably be thinking about

25:32.000 --> 25:33.290
capturing the Spider's Nest.

25:34.590 --> 25:36.420
The Xie and Mu families have united.

25:37.590 --> 25:38.380
I heard about it.

25:39.480 --> 25:40.180
The Twelve Zodiacs of Spider Shadow

25:40.200 --> 25:41.050
will be prepared

25:41.920 --> 25:42.860
for their arrival.

25:44.110 --> 25:44.730
The Su family

25:45.790 --> 25:47.900
won't stand idly and do nothing.

25:49.350 --> 25:50.460
Who is

25:51.350 --> 25:52.220
commanding them?

25:54.270 --> 25:55.010
It's Changhe.

25:58.960 --> 26:00.530
It's your buddy.

26:04.510 --> 26:05.050
Sir,

26:05.750 --> 26:07.090
Changhe has no choice

26:07.640 --> 26:08.460
after taking orders from the Su family.

26:09.920 --> 26:11.290
He is here to take my life.

26:12.030 --> 26:13.380
As the Kui...

26:14.510 --> 26:14.940
I will

26:14.960 --> 26:15.980
still complete my mission

26:16.720 --> 26:18.010
to stop the rebellion of the Three Families

26:19.000 --> 26:20.050
and cure your illness.

26:26.400 --> 26:27.250
Muyu.

26:27.720 --> 26:28.660
Su Muyu!

26:30.110 --> 26:31.770
You are the most conflicted

26:32.400 --> 26:33.570
and firm person I've seen.

26:34.590 --> 26:37.010
However, the sword technique of this buddy of yours

26:37.680 --> 26:39.900
seems to be stronger than mine.

26:56.480 --> 26:57.810
The gentle spring breeze is nice.

26:58.550 --> 26:59.700
What a comfortable season.

27:02.270 --> 27:03.770
Outside the Spider's Nest that day,

27:04.510 --> 27:05.940
it was the Xie family's blade that killed the man

27:06.750 --> 27:07.770
but the one who set up the Heavenly Web Array

27:08.680 --> 27:09.860
was the Mu family's ghost?

27:12.480 --> 27:12.980
Yes.

27:13.440 --> 27:14.860
The Xie and Mu families are working together now.

27:15.440 --> 27:16.620
We, the Su family,

27:16.640 --> 27:17.380
are alone now.

27:19.270 --> 27:21.010
Look how bad the Old Man

27:21.440 --> 27:22.180
is getting along with others.

27:24.680 --> 27:25.660
However, there will

27:25.720 --> 27:26.900
only be one winner in this battle.

27:27.640 --> 27:29.140
Even if they are working together now,

27:29.440 --> 27:29.860
they will still

27:30.270 --> 27:31.770
fight each other in the future.

27:33.880 --> 27:34.620
What do you think?

27:35.750 --> 27:36.250
Me?

27:38.110 --> 27:39.900
I'll just sit, stand,

27:40.070 --> 27:40.770
or even lie down

27:42.000 --> 27:43.090
to watch them fight.

27:47.070 --> 27:48.420
Owner, one suite.

27:49.000 --> 27:49.660
One?

27:50.480 --> 27:50.860
Sure.

27:51.830 --> 27:52.980
The most expensive and best suite!

27:53.200 --> 27:53.730
Laifu!

27:54.880 --> 27:55.700
Bring the guests upstairs!

27:56.030 --> 27:56.570
Sure!

28:00.510 --> 28:00.980
This way, please.

28:02.030 --> 28:02.620
Take care.

28:07.110 --> 28:09.330
This man is lucky with women.

28:33.440 --> 28:35.010
As expected, you still can't get over me.

28:36.000 --> 28:37.010
I have nothing against you.

28:38.070 --> 28:38.810
There's no reason to kill you.

28:45.110 --> 28:46.250
Before I passed out,

28:46.880 --> 28:48.050
I fell into your arms

28:48.720 --> 28:50.090
and heard

28:50.640 --> 28:51.660
your heart beating.

28:52.400 --> 28:54.180
Your heart was beating very quickly.

28:54.920 --> 28:56.050
Were you afraid that I'd die?

28:58.590 --> 28:59.010
No.

28:59.480 --> 29:01.620
If you are not worried that I might die,

29:02.350 --> 29:03.220
you must have felt shy.

29:05.720 --> 29:06.570
I told you I wasn't.

29:11.880 --> 29:12.940
You weren't?

29:14.510 --> 29:16.010
Perhaps I heard wrongly.

29:23.030 --> 29:24.330
Xuanwu Guardian,

29:24.920 --> 29:26.050
why don't you come here

29:26.440 --> 29:27.980
and let me hear your heartbeat again?

29:28.550 --> 29:29.900
Let me see if it's still the same as that time?

29:35.790 --> 29:36.460
Yue,

29:37.510 --> 29:38.810
it's late now.

29:40.640 --> 29:41.420
Do you want to rest with me?

29:58.920 --> 29:59.770
You are still injured.

30:00.830 --> 30:01.860
Don't waste your energy talking.

30:03.000 --> 30:04.010
When I wake up tomorrow,

30:06.030 --> 30:07.010
you'll leave, right?

30:10.030 --> 30:10.810
Actually,

30:11.400 --> 30:12.380
I might behave like this

30:13.590 --> 30:14.250
but I only like

30:14.440 --> 30:15.810
to tease people with words.

30:16.240 --> 30:18.460
If you don't like it, I won't tease you anymore.

30:22.160 --> 30:23.730
However, you are obviously enjoying this.

30:35.070 --> 30:35.810
Forget it.

30:36.200 --> 30:36.940
I'm tired.

30:37.790 --> 30:38.940
I can't speak too much.

30:39.920 --> 30:41.730
If you want to sleep on the bed,

30:44.000 --> 30:44.940
come over yourself.

30:46.720 --> 30:47.530
I won't be

30:47.920 --> 30:48.940
begging you.

30:50.550 --> 30:51.620
In the last twenty years,

30:52.440 --> 30:53.860
people have been pursuing me.

30:56.200 --> 30:56.730
I've never had

30:56.750 --> 30:58.380
a chance to pursue someone.

31:01.160 --> 31:01.620
I'm going out.

31:02.480 --> 31:03.140
What's wrong?

31:06.440 --> 31:07.050
I drank too much water.

31:19.110 --> 31:21.250
Half lost in the river wind, half hidden in the clouds.

31:23.720 --> 31:24.530
When you first entered the inn,

31:25.510 --> 31:26.140
I thought

31:26.240 --> 31:27.460
your back looked familiar.

31:28.160 --> 31:28.900
It's you, indeed.

31:31.070 --> 31:32.460
Why didn't you dare confront me just now

31:33.200 --> 31:34.460
yet you come and see me now?

31:37.550 --> 31:38.860
I avoided you when I didn't feel like meeting you.

31:39.270 --> 31:41.490
Now that I feel like it, I've come to meet you.

31:45.070 --> 31:45.770
The person inside the room

31:46.070 --> 31:47.010
is from Blood River.

31:48.240 --> 31:49.140
Since you are here,

31:49.830 --> 31:50.770
I'll leave her to you.

31:51.400 --> 31:52.530
I want to kill the Patriarch.

31:53.110 --> 31:54.730
I'm not interested in other members of Blood River.

31:56.240 --> 31:56.900
The person inside the room

31:56.960 --> 31:58.090
is the Patriarch's guardian.

31:58.680 --> 32:00.010
The reason why I come here

32:00.480 --> 32:01.810
is to kill the Patriarch.

32:02.680 --> 32:03.940
If you leave her to me,

32:05.160 --> 32:05.900
I will

32:07.680 --> 32:08.420
kill her.

32:12.830 --> 32:13.490
Back so soon?

32:15.240 --> 32:16.460
Did you relieve yourself in front of the door?

32:20.830 --> 32:21.420
Changhe?

32:21.510 --> 32:22.140
It's me.

32:26.000 --> 32:26.730
Have you gone mad?

32:28.720 --> 32:29.460
It seems like

32:29.550 --> 32:30.860
you still care about

32:31.350 --> 32:33.050
the prettiest woman of Blood River.

32:34.270 --> 32:35.180
You were testing me?

32:35.400 --> 32:35.900
Not at all.

32:36.720 --> 32:37.420
I just wanted to see

32:37.510 --> 32:38.940
if my Inch Sword is better

32:39.200 --> 32:40.660
or your Fingertip Blade is deadlier.

32:41.510 --> 32:42.180
However,

32:42.510 --> 32:43.490
today is not the right time.

32:44.200 --> 32:44.700
Yumo,

32:45.720 --> 32:46.290
have you decided

32:46.310 --> 32:47.050
to side with Su Muyu?

32:47.550 --> 32:48.380
I'm not siding with anyone.

32:49.590 --> 32:50.860
I'll be sleeping here.

32:51.480 --> 32:52.050
I hope

32:52.790 --> 32:53.700
you don't disturb me.

32:54.000 --> 32:55.140
It seems like

32:55.550 --> 32:56.940
Su Muyu is more important to you.

32:58.160 --> 32:58.770
Otherwise,

32:59.480 --> 33:00.940
you wouldn't help him buy time

33:01.310 --> 33:02.980
from the most dangerous guy in the Tang Clan.

33:06.160 --> 33:07.420
Don't say such nonsense.

33:08.270 --> 33:10.090
I'm clinging to Young Master Tang

33:11.110 --> 33:12.090
because I like him.

33:15.750 --> 33:16.290
Is that so?

33:17.110 --> 33:18.530
A few years ago,

33:18.550 --> 33:19.700
you even said you wanted to marry Su Muyu.

33:21.590 --> 33:23.860
Women are so fickle.

33:28.830 --> 33:29.420
Xuanwu Guardian,

33:30.400 --> 33:31.140
if you do care

33:31.240 --> 33:32.010
about my younger sister,

33:32.240 --> 33:33.770
you should protect her for a few more days.

33:34.440 --> 33:36.860
The tides are turning in Jiuxiao City.

33:37.590 --> 33:38.980
I'll help you

33:39.960 --> 33:40.980
get the Patriarch's head.

34:10.320 --> 34:10.820
Yu.

34:11.880 --> 34:12.740
They left Chou's body

34:13.550 --> 34:14.820
outside of Spider's Nest.

34:15.840 --> 34:16.980
They are trying to assert their dominance.

34:18.070 --> 34:19.010
We examined the body.

34:19.670 --> 34:20.980
He died from a blade injury

34:21.710 --> 34:22.650
but he was already poisoned

34:22.760 --> 34:23.900
by the Mu family's young master with his butterfly poison.

34:24.960 --> 34:25.570
The blade strike

34:26.800 --> 34:28.090
actually gave him an easier death.

34:28.760 --> 34:29.170
Boss,

34:30.150 --> 34:31.460
why did you let Chou go?

34:34.440 --> 34:35.260
This is no longer important.

34:36.280 --> 34:37.420
The Three Families

34:37.480 --> 34:38.170
are not going

34:38.190 --> 34:39.570
to let any one of us live.

34:40.920 --> 34:41.740
Even if it's just

34:41.800 --> 34:43.490
an uninvolved person who wants to stay out of this conflict.

34:44.960 --> 34:45.780
In that case,

34:47.550 --> 34:48.460
we'll let the Three Families

34:48.480 --> 34:49.780
pay for this.

34:51.190 --> 34:51.780
Everyone,

34:53.840 --> 34:55.490
please guard the Spider's Nest tonight.

34:56.360 --> 34:56.860
- Yes! - Yes!

34:58.800 --> 34:59.420
We won't stop

35:01.150 --> 35:02.260
until we die!

35:05.740 --> 35:09.180
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:09.190 --> 35:13.130
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

35:15.020 --> 35:18.440
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

35:18.450 --> 35:22.850
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

35:24.580 --> 35:27.790
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

35:28.070 --> 35:30.090
♪Still I can't let go♪

35:30.140 --> 35:33.590
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

35:33.780 --> 35:36.000
♪My heart no longer my own♪

35:36.250 --> 35:41.770
♪No one can escape from love♪

35:57.550 --> 36:01.300
♪How many hidden feelings♪

36:01.620 --> 36:04.810
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

36:06.910 --> 36:10.680
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

36:10.950 --> 36:14.740
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

36:16.110 --> 36:19.130
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

36:19.350 --> 36:23.490
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

36:25.590 --> 36:29.710
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

36:29.800 --> 36:33.260
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

